Paper Summary
This study compares two 8-week resistance-training programs in trained men: high-volume/moderate-intensity versus high-intensity/lower-volume. It evaluates changes in muscle size, strength, muscle activation, and hormonal responses to determine which loading strategy produces greater adaptations.


